flowchart LR
  Scheduler[Sidekiq scheduler] -->|hourly :10| RefreshScan[RefreshScanJob]
  RefreshScan --> RefreshLoc[RefreshLocationJob]
  RefreshLoc --> Adapter[Adapter fetch_snapshot]
  Adapter -->|citypage XML| Store[(current, forecasts, hourly live_feed observation)]
  Scheduler -->|daily 06:30| BackfillScan[BackfillScanJob]
  BackfillScan --> BackfillLoc[BackfillLocationJob]
  BackfillLoc --> History[Adapter fetch_observations]
  History -->|climate-hourly, climate-daily| Gaps{missing or null?}
  Gaps -->|create or fill only| Store
  Store --> Pages[Settlement pages and charts read stored rows only]
  Scheduler -->|daily 04:45| Purge[PurgeJob retention]
  Purge --> Store
